 "text": "9/29/26, 10:15 AM\n\nIn addition to interest, you can also levy various charges on your business partner. If you set the indicator Interest before Charges ,\nyou can define whether the interest is to be calculated before the charges in the dunning activity run. This is necessary, for\nexample, if the amount of the charges is to be dependent on the interest calculated. To create this dependence, define a function\n\nmodule for event 0360 in the Implementation Guide for Contract Accounts Receivable and Payable under Program\nEnhancements \u2014 Define Customer-Specific Function Modules . SAP delivers function module FKK_SPECIALCHARGE_0360 as an\nexample implementation for such a calculation. This enables you to restrict the amount of the dunning charges if you levy dunning\ninterest as well as dunning charges.\n\nDefine the minimum interest amount that can be posted for a dunning notice.\n\nFor detailed information, see the documentation for the corresponding fields.\n\nDisplay Dunning Run Exceptions\n\nThe Display Dunning Run Exceptions ( F7575) app provides a detailed view of the exceptions that occurred for business partners\nin a dunning run.\n\nKey Features\n\nYou select the required exceptions by using the available filters, such as Dunning Run Date, Dunning Run ID, and Business\nPartner.\n\nIn the overview, you can jump to the detail view of the selected exceptions to track the errors that led to the exception.\n\nIntegration\n\nIn the Analyze Dunning Run Exceptions app, if you select a business partner for whom dunning exceptions exist in the overview\nand then choose Display Dunning Exceptions, you branch to the Display Dunning Run Exceptions app.\n\nSAP Fiori Implementation Information\n\nFor information about implementation of the Display Dunning Run Exceptions app, see SAP Fiori Apps Reference Library.\n\nRelated Information\n\nAnalyze Dunning Run Exceptions\n\nModifications in the Program Sequence\n\nUse\n\nIn the following events you can influence the dunning process:\n\nEvent                                                                                                             Function\n\n0307                                                                                       In event 0307, you can determine, in the dunning proposal run, the\n",
